<title>USA: Fifth Third Bancorp raises payout.</title>
<headline>Fifth Third Bancorp raises payout.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $0.33		     $0.29</p>
<p> Pay	     July 15</p>
<p> Record	  June 30</p>
<p>NOTE: The company also said it approved a three-for-two stock split with the same pay and record date.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
